  "text": "P\nPhenoFarm\nDISPENSARY\n18\n\nWHOLESALE REQUEST\n\nRequest draft\n\nBuild a wholesale request for growers to review. PhenoFarm does not collect wholesale payment.\n\nItems\nLogistics\nTerms\n4\nReview\n\nSmart request defaults\n\nReuse the logistics, terms, and notes that worked last time.\n\nUse standard terms\nPrices and inventory refreshed. Unavailable items remain in your draft for review.\n\nPurple Haze Flowers\n\nVermont Nurseries • $25/Gram\n\n-\n+\n\n$50.00\n\nLogistics\nFulfillment method\nFlexible\nPickup\nDelivery requested\nCoordinate with grower\nRequested window (optional)\n\n0/120\n\nTerms and Notes\nDirect payment terms\nHandled directly\nNet 15\nNet 30\nACH\nCheck\nCOD\n\nInformational only. PhenoFarm does not process wholesale settlement.\n\nNotes or special instructions\nPickup\nDelivery\nSubstitutions\nPayment terms\n\n0/500\n\nRequest Summary\nEstimated item value\n$50.00\nPayment terms are coordinated directly between buyer and grower.\nThis draft will create one grower request.\nFulfillment\nFlexible\nPayment terms\nHandled directly\n\nOptional fixes before review\n\nAdd a timing window\nA pickup, delivery, or flexible receiving window reduces follow-up messages.\nAdd a short note\nReceiving instructions, substitutions, or PO context help growers respond faster.\nReview Request\nReview Order Request\n\nConfirm grower splits, value, logistics, and direct payment terms before submitting.\n\n✕\n\nREVIEW MODE\n\nConfirm before submitting\n\nItems\n\n1 item\n\nEdit\n\nGrower requests\n\n1\n\nEdit\n\nFulfillment\n\nFlexible\n\nEdit\n\nDirect terms\n\nHandled directly\n\nEdit\nVermont Nurseries\n\nVermont buyers · Handled directly\n\n$50.00\n2 × Purple Haze Flowers\n$50.00\nInventory is checked again when you submit. If quantities changed, the draft will be adjusted before any request is created.\nEstimated item value\n$50.00\n\nNo wholesale payment is collected in PhenoFarm.\n\nBack to Draft\nSubmit Order Request\n\nReview grower splits before submitting.\n\nAdd\nReview request",
